    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG McGill Longford and Carrick on Shannon bring to the market this superb detached residence on a generous site approximately 0.75 Acres providing a stunning family home in a beautiful setting. Located only a short drive from the popular Newtownforbes primary school and Mels College, Longford Golf Club and immediately adjacent to N4 with Longford Town within minutes' drive and within 15 kms from Carrick on Shannon. Immediate access to the various major routes - Only 2 km to N4, Athlone (30 mins) and Dublin (1hr 20mins to Dublin Airport).This beautiful home offers a spacious c 124 sq m of accommodation to include Living room, large kitchen /diner flanked by roomy family utility and wc, 3 sizable bedrooms with master on suite and main bathroom. The property sits back perfectly from the road which allows great privacy to front and rear on well kept gardens which enjoy lawns, mature shrubs and trees and large tarmacadam driveway with plenty parking. With a west facing aspect to the rear, it's perfect to enjoy barbecues etc. In walk in condition, some of the appealing features include wonderful natural light throughout and strikingtiled floors with some very tasteful window features. The property has PVC double glazed windows throughout, oil fired central heating. The detached Garage has a residential front installed outside the standard garage door and can be converted to office space if required."
      },
